OL,3,GNEWSAScrutiny panel will delve for
OL,4,Aclarity on budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public hearing is due to scrutinise
OL,7,Fdecisions being made by politicians
OL,8,Fafter two budgets for 2027 were put
OL,9,Fforward amid what has been described as
OL,10,Fa "shifting narrative".
OL,12,FDeputy Andy Sloan, who will sit on the
OL,13,FScrutiny Management Committee (SMC)
OL,14,Fpanel, said the picture presented of
OL,15,Fpublic finances had "changed
OL,16,Fremarkably" over a 12-month period.
OL,18,FSloan, who has been critical of the
OL,19,FStates presenting two budgets to the
OL,20,Fassembly, said it was important to
OL,21,F"establish a clearer picture" of the
OL,22,Ffinancial position facing the States.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
